{"Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.connie.rising.mystery.moon.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.connie.rising.mystery.moon", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Rising While", "startdescription": "'All right; I'll tell you the oracle. 'The Great Debasement is no Great Counterfeit'. I thought it was nothing when I heard it - a joke, a trick - but the deeper I dig, the less I like it. The Bureau has always tried to stand apart from the affairs of state... but I don't know how much longer that will be possible.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．moon": "interest.moon", "incident．rising": 1, "connie": 1, "acted．connie．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.moon", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.connie.rising.moon", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.connie", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.rising", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.connie"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.connie.rite.renewal.mystery.moon.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.connie.rite.renewal.mystery.moon", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Friar's Tapestry", "startdescription": "''From darkness, darkness.' Wish me luck.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．moon": "interest.moon", "incident．rite．renewal": 1, "connie": 1, "acted．connie．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.moon", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.connie.rite.renewal.moon", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.connie", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.rite.renewal", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.connie"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.box.mystery.knock.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.box.mystery.knock", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Messenger's Casket", "startdescription": "'Wonderful idea. You can tell me how clever I am, if you fancy. People do.  Thank you, darling!' ", "reqs": {"mystery．knock": "interest.knock", "incident．box": 1, "coquille": 1, "acted．coquille．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.coquille.box.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.coquille", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.box", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.coquille"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.heist.mystery.knock.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.heist.mystery.knock", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Oriflamme Heist", "startdescription": "'I wonder… do you know, I think I might just have tripped over something rather smashing, here. Thank you so very, darling, a very thank you!' ", "reqs": {"mystery．knock": "interest.knock", "incident．heist": 1, "coquille": 1, "acted．coquille．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.coquille.heist.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.coquille", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.heist", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.coquille"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.intrusion.mystery.knock.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.intrusion.mystery.knock", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Endless Guest", "startdescription": "'Do you know, all the stories do seem to put the sword Ebrehel in Kraków… and now I'm beginning to think that makes a sort of sense. Thank you, darling!' ", "reqs": {"mystery．knock": "interest.knock", "incident．intrusion": 1, "coquille": 1, "acted．coquille．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.coquille.intrusion.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.coquille", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.intrusion", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.coquille"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.opera.apollo.mystery.grail.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.opera.apollo.mystery.grail", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On 'Apollo and Marsyas'", "startdescription": "'Smudgy little line between ghastly and thrilling, darling, isn't there? But I rather think this is on the right side of the line.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．grail": "interest.grail", "incident．opera．apollo": 1, "coquille": 1, "acted．coquille．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.coquille.opera.apollo.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.coquille", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.opera.apollo", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.coquille"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.opera.wings.mystery.grail.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.opera.wings.mystery.grail", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the 'Invisible Opera'", "startdescription": "'One does follow some odd little byways, doesn't one? Perhaps there's something in it. We'll see. Off to Venice!' ", "reqs": {"mystery．grail": "interest.grail", "incident．opera．wings": 1, "coquille": 1, "acted．coquille．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.coquille.opera.wings.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.coquille", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.opera.wings", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.coquille"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.revolution.mystery.grail.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.coquille.revolution.mystery.grail", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Threshold Revolution", "startdescription": "'I have the most <i>exquisite</i> idea! Here - something for your trouble.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．grail": "interest.grail", "incident．revolution": 1, "coquille": 1, "acted．coquille．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.coquille.revolution.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.coquille", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.revolution", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.coquille"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.mystical.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.mystical.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Particular Mystique", "startdescription": "'Found something, Librarian. You heard of the Chandler? Might be an Hour, might be a myth. Not recognised by the Church, either way. I'd never made the connection with Sunset Celia. I wonder if the Archbishop will pay me to explain it to him… or if he'll pay me not to.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．mystical": 1, "corso": 1, "acted．corso．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.corso.mystical.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.corso", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.mystical", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.corso"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.omen.dawn.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.omen.dawn.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Unfettered Eye", "startdescription": "'That clinches it. They've been sold a pup. Their manuscript can't be older than the eighteenth century. Maybe I won't tell them that, eh, Librarian? Clients don't like paying for bad news.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．omen．dawn": 1, "corso": 1, "acted．corso．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.corso.omen.dawn.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.corso", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.omen.dawn", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.corso"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.opera.apollo.mystery.grail.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.opera.apollo.mystery.grail", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On 'Apollo and Marsyas'", "startdescription": "'Thanks, Librarian. I'll know what to look for now. Keep this between us, will you? I hope I can just buy the book, but its owner's reputation is, eh, he's not always co-operative, you know?' ", "reqs": {"mystery．grail": "interest.grail", "incident．opera．apollo": 1, "corso": 1, "acted．corso．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.corso.opera.apollo.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.corso", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.opera.apollo", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.corso"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.opera.wings.mystery.grail.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.opera.wings.mystery.grail", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the 'Invisible Opera'", "startdescription": "'I have what I need. I'll see myself out. Bye, Librarian.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．grail": "interest.grail", "incident．opera．wings": 1, "corso": 1, "acted．corso．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.corso.opera.wings.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.corso", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.opera.wings", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.corso"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.project.solar.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.project.solar.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Royal Endeavour", "startdescription": "'I'll be honest, Librarian, I don’t think anything I've found will reassure our foreign friends. Well, if they don't start a war, I won't either. Good luck with your New King.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．project．solar": 1, "corso": 1, "acted．corso．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.corso.project.solar.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.corso", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.project.solar", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.corso"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.revolution.mystery.grail.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.corso.revolution.mystery.grail", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Threshold Revolution", "startdescription": "'I think that'll do it. Thanks, Librarian. Off to the zoo, I suppose…' ", "reqs": {"mystery．grail": "interest.grail", "incident．revolution": 1, "corso": 1, "acted．corso．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.corso.revolution.grail", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.corso", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.revolution", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.corso"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.box.mystery.knock.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.box.mystery.knock", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Messenger's Casket", "startdescription": "'Jolly good. Enough Names scorching up the place, what? More than enough. Pip pip.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．knock": "interest.knock", "incident．box": 1, "dagmar": 1, "acted．dagmar．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.dagmar.box.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.dagmar", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.box", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.dagmar"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.heist.mystery.knock.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.heist.mystery.knock", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Oriflamme Heist", "startdescription": "'Thank you, dear. Cheered me up a bit. Bright side, sort of thing. Pip pip.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．knock": "interest.knock", "incident．heist": 1, "dagmar": 1, "acted．dagmar．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.dagmar.heist.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.dagmar", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.heist", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.dagmar"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.intrusion.mystery.knock.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.intrusion.mystery.knock", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Endless Guest", "startdescription": "'Seal 'em up like Christmas, see if I won't. Pip pip. Pip pip! Ha ha! Box-room!' ", "reqs": {"mystery．knock": "interest.knock", "incident．intrusion": 1, "dagmar": 1, "acted．dagmar．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.dagmar.intrusion.knock", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.dagmar", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.intrusion", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.dagmar"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.lost.find.mystery.rose.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.lost.find.mystery.rose", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Dappled Rose", "startdescription": "'Dappled rose. Still don't know. But the Vagabond liked gardens, don't you know. And Moth. Might go back to Miah after all. I wonder…' ", "reqs": {"mystery．rose": "interest.rose", "incident．lost．find": 1, "dagmar": 1, "acted．dagmar．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.rose", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.dagmar.lost.find.rose", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.dagmar", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.lost.find", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.dagmar"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.omen.horizon.mystery.rose.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.omen.horizon.mystery.rose", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Other Horizon", "startdescription": "'Found something. Might be something else. Might be something I'll regret.  Mum's the word, hm? Word to the wise. Pip pip, dear, pip pip.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．rose": "interest.rose", "incident．omen．horizon": 1, "dagmar": 1, "acted．dagmar．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.rose", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.dagmar.omen.horizon.rose", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.dagmar", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.omen.horizon", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.dagmar"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.stalk.mystery.rose.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.dagmar.stalk.mystery.rose", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Absent Friend", "startdescription": "'Funny things on the horizon. Mark my words. Funny sort of things. Well, I do thank you, dear. Here's a little something.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．rose": "interest.rose", "incident．stalk": 1, "dagmar": 1, "acted．dagmar．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.rose", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.dagmar.stalk.rose", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.dagmar", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.stalk", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.dagmar"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.curse.mystery.heart.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.curse.mystery.heart", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Grunewald Provision", "startdescription": "'Right. Thanks. Might have a sporting chance of not getting et from the inside out, now. Much obliged.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．heart": "interest.heart", "incident．curse": 1, "douglas": 1, "acted．douglas．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.douglas.curse.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.douglas", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.curse", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.douglas"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.mystical.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.mystical.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Particular Mystique", "startdescription": "'Yeah, it's all looking a bit Long-er. More Long means more oneiric hazard, more devouring spirits running around, and sooner or later more Crime of the Sky. I don't know if you know what that is. I wish I didn't.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．mystical": 1, "douglas": 1, "acted．douglas．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.douglas.mystical.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.douglas", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.mystical", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.douglas"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.omen.dawn.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.omen.dawn.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Unfettered Eye", "startdescription": "'Well, look, I can't pretend I know what's happening over there, but I'll tell the boss you helped shed some light on the situation. That's a joke. Man of my word, me.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．omen．dawn": 1, "douglas": 1, "acted．douglas．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.douglas.omen.dawn.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.douglas", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.omen.dawn", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.douglas"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.pan.mystery.heart.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.pan.mystery.heart", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the God in the Wood", "startdescription": "'Nothing too sinister here. Well, more artists in the world. Strikes me as a sinister sort of phenomenon all by its own self. But nothing for the Bureau, I reckon. Thanks.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．heart": "interest.heart", "incident．pan": 1, "douglas": 1, "acted．douglas．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.douglas.pan.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.douglas", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.pan", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.douglas"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.project.solar.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.project.solar.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Royal Endeavour", "startdescription": "'Thanks for that. Got a much better idea of who might need arresting. Mrs M's going to like that. No time at all for the Church, Mrs M. Proper freethinker. 'Never mind all them poor mediums,' says she, 'lock up a bishop or two, save all that money on silly hats.' Told her once if we locked people up for spending too much on millinery, she'd need to watch out. Had to eat my dinner in the garden shed that evening. Anyway, ta ta.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．project．solar": 1, "douglas": 1, "acted．douglas．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.douglas.project.solar.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.douglas", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.project.solar", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.douglas"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.wound.mystery.heart.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.douglas.wound.mystery.heart", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Open Reverend", "startdescription": "'Thought so. 'O.R.' is a walking oneiric hazard. Well, not 'walking', poor bloke. Going to have to recommend something pretty permanent. Thanks, Librarian.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．heart": "interest.heart", "incident．wound": 1, "douglas": 1, "acted．douglas．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.douglas.wound.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.douglas", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.wound", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.douglas"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.curse.mystery.heart.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.curse.mystery.heart", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Grunewald Provision", "startdescription": "'Nothing's Nothing-proof, eh, Librarian? But I hope I know now how I might protect myself.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．heart": "interest.heart", "incident．curse": 1, "ehsan": 1, "acted．ehsan．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.ehsan.curse.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.ehsan", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.curse", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.ehsan"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.observe.scaly.mystery.sky.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.observe.scaly.mystery.sky", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Claw and the Clouds", "startdescription": "'I understand now how I might close their eyes to the skies. Not every appetite should be fed, Librarian. They will be very grateful when the mania has passed. And their families will be grateful now. We cannot be two things at once… no, I am not easy with this. But I choose the lesser harm. Thank you for your help.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．sky": "interest.sky", "incident．observe．scaly": 1, "ehsan": 1, "acted．ehsan．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.sky", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.ehsan.observe.scaly.sky", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.ehsan", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.observe.scaly", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.ehsan"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.opera.apollo.mystery.sky.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.opera.apollo.mystery.sky", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On 'Apollo and Marsyas'", "startdescription": "'I am reassured. Perhaps, after all, no storm will stir; perhaps everyone will just have a good night out. It surely must happen sooner or later. ' ", "reqs": {"mystery．sky": "interest.sky", "incident．opera．apollo": 1, "ehsan": 1, "acted．ehsan．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.sky", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.ehsan.opera.apollo.sky", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.ehsan", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.opera.apollo", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.ehsan"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.pan.mystery.heart.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.pan.mystery.heart", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the God in the Wood", "startdescription": "'The text is useful - thank you! - but now that I'm back at Brancrug, I've realised the oddest thing. The work that's coming out of this place - it's very like the work that Thirza Blake used to do. I'm sure you know she was librarian here before you… perhaps a coincidence. Perhaps not.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．heart": "interest.heart", "incident．pan": 1, "ehsan": 1, "acted．ehsan．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.ehsan.pan.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.ehsan", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.pan", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.ehsan"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.project.ingenious.mystery.sky.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.project.ingenious.mystery.sky", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Unfinished Lark", "startdescription": "'Oh, Zuthi. He was a much greater craftsman than I had realised… and I think it might have been the death of him. Perhaps this Unfinished Lark should remain Unfinished. Thank you, Librarian.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．sky": "interest.sky", "incident．project．ingenious": 1, "ehsan": 1, "acted．ehsan．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.sky", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.ehsan.project.ingenious.sky", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.ehsan", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.project.ingenious", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.ehsan"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.wound.mystery.heart.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.ehsan.wound.mystery.heart", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Open Reverend", "startdescription": "'I fear this 'O.R.' has invited the attentions of the Mother of Ants. If so there is little I can do for him. But I can try. Thank you, Librarian.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．heart": "interest.heart", "incident．wound": 1, "ehsan": 1, "acted．ehsan．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.ehsan.wound.heart", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.ehsan", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.wound", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.ehsan"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.hunt.changing.mystery.scale.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.hunt.changing.mystery.scale", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Second Skin", "startdescription": "''History is hybrid; Eternity pure.' I wish I could protect Abecassis. I would have liked to speak with him…' ", "reqs": {"mystery．scale": "interest.scale", "incident．hunt．changing": 1, "fraser": 1, "acted．fraser．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.scale", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.fraser.hunt.changing.scale", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.fraser", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.hunt.changing", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.fraser"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.mystical.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.mystical.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Particular Mystique", "startdescription": "'I can't believe this is a coincidence. The Obliviates are back in the world… and the Obliviates never come back to the world. Something is afoot in Port Noon.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．mystical": 1, "fraser": 1, "acted．fraser．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.fraser.mystical.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.fraser", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.mystical", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.fraser"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.observe.scaly.mystery.scale.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.observe.scaly.mystery.scale", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Claw and the Clouds", "startdescription": "'We have waited so long, Librarian. So long that no memory goes all the way back; not even the memories beneath the skin.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．scale": "interest.scale", "incident．observe．scaly": 1, "fraser": 1, "acted．fraser．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.scale", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.fraser.observe.scaly.scale", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.fraser", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.observe.scaly", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.fraser"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.omen.dawn.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.omen.dawn.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Unfettered Eye", "startdescription": "'No; it is something else. My dreams will not see daylight yet. Perhaps they never will. Thank you, Librarian.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．omen．dawn": 1, "fraser": 1, "acted．fraser．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.fraser.omen.dawn.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.fraser", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.omen.dawn", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.fraser"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.project.solar.mystery.lantern.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.project.solar.mystery.lantern", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Royal Endeavour", "startdescription": "'Battleships; aerostats; locomotives. What do all these things have in common, Librarian? I'll tell you: names. Thank you. Good day.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．lantern": "interest.lantern", "incident．project．solar": 1, "fraser": 1, "acted．fraser．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.fraser.project.solar.lantern", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.fraser", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.project.solar", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.fraser"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.rising.mystery.scale.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.rising.mystery.scale", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Rising While", "startdescription": "'And now I'm certain. The most noble lineage of the Carapace Cross was the Scīmafectra-kind… the Glory-winged. It is a lineage I have always felt a particular affinity with. A great day, Librarian; a great day is coming.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．scale": "interest.scale", "incident．rising": 1, "fraser": 1, "acted．fraser．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.scale", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.fraser.rising.scale", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.fraser", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.rising", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.fraser"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.rite.awakening.mystery.scale.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.fraser.rite.awakening.mystery.scale", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Sandalwood Saint", "startdescription": "'I shall enjoin the Church to drown it. The conservative clerics will be satisfied with this outcome. And those clerics who share my secret sympathies… they will hope, as I do, that in darkness and in quiet, it might develop further.' ", "reqs": {"mystery．scale": "interest.scale", "incident．rite．awakening": 1, "fraser": 1, "acted．fraser．*": -1}, "effects": {"spintria．bronze": 1}, "aspects": {"satisfying": 1}, "mutations": [{"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "interest.scale", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "incident", "mutate": "acted.fraser.rite.awakening.scale", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "readable", "mutate": "tx.fraser", "level": 1, "additive": true}, {"filter": "visitor", "mutate": "v.rite.awakening", "level": 1, "additive": false}], "linked": [{"id": "talk.visitor.offer.callingcard.fraser"}]}, "Data:Talk.visitor.incident.success.hokobald.heist.mystery.forge.json": {"id": "talk.visitor.incident.success.hokobald.heist.mystery.forge", "actionid": "talk", "label": "On the Oriflamme Heist", "startdescription": "'I suppose that will have to do. Here. It is over-generous, but then I am an over-generous person. It may perhaps be my 